    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$2.06 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for a loaded Tex-Mex casserole that a casual restaurant would happily charge you $12 a plate for. The whole 14-serving batch costs less than lunch out for two.",
